        "smooth_type": {
          "exclude": true,
          "_comment": "opencadcodec defines two distinct SmoothSurfaceType enums with the same name (polyline.rs, used by Polyline2D's smooth_surface \u2014 and a separate one private to polyline3d.rs, used here); the type registry's tracer keys purely by name and collapses them, so the generically generated conversion resolves to the wrong one. Needs a hand-written override with the fully qualified opencadcodec::entities::polyline3d::SmoothSurfaceType path to support, not just a rename."
        }
      }
